==English==
{{wikipedia|Slider (disambiguation)}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|aɪdə(r)|lang=en}}

===Etymology===
{{suffix|slide|er|lang=en}}

{{rfe|lang=en|hamburger sense}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{non-gloss definition|[[agent noun|Agent noun]] of [[slide]]:}} one who slides.
# A [[sliding door]].
# {{label|en|baseball}} A [[pitch]] thrown with added pressure by middle and ring fingers yielding a combination of backspin and [[sidespin]], resulting in a motion to the left when thrown by a right handed pitcher.
#: ''The [[closer]] had a wicked '''slider''' that was almost unhittable.''
# {{label|en|cricket}} A similar [[delivery]] in which the wrist and ring finger work to impart [[backspin]] to the [[ball]].
# A small [[hamburger]].
#: ''We ordered five '''sliders'''.''
# {{label|en|curling}} A piece of [[teflon]] or similar material attached to a [[curling]] shoe that allows the player to slide along the ice.
# {{label|en|graphical user interface}} A [[widget]] allowing the [[user]] to select a [[value]] or [[position]] on a sliding [[scale]].
# {{label|en|US|dialect}} ''Pseudemys rugosa'', the red-bellied [[terrapin]].
# {{label|en|skydiving}} A rectangle of fabric that helps produce an orderly parachute deployment.

